ion":"**This is a 24 hour competition!**\r\nAs such it won't be very newcomer and kid friendly, so please keep that in mind.\r\n\r\nMake sure that you are active on your WCA email account. As a result of not doing so, your registration might get removed as we will very likely send you some important information regarding the competition and ask you to confirm that you will attend!\r\nPlease read carefully all the tabs, especially \"judging\"!\r\n\r\nThere is a competitor limit of 14 for multiBLD and 35 for FMC.\r\n\r\n**Toto je 24 hodinov\u00e1 sout\u011b\u017e!**\r\nJako takov\u00e1 nen\u00ed nejvhodn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed prvn\u00ed sout\u011b\u017e\u00ed, ani sout\u011b\u017e\u00ed vhodnou pro mlad\u0161\u00ed speedcubery, zva\u017ete proto pros\u00edm pe\u010dliv\u011b svou \u00fa\u010dast.\r\n\r\nUjist\u011bte se, \u017ee email pou\u017eit\u00fd p\u0159i registraci na WCA opravdu pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1te. Velmi pravd\u011bpodobn\u011b V\u00e1m po\u0161leme d\u016fle\u017eit\u00e9 informace a budeme \u017e\u00e1dat o potvrzen\u00ed \u00fa\u010dasti. Nebudete-li reagovat, Va\u0161e registrace m\u016f\u017ee b\u00fdt smaz\u00e1na!\r\nPros\u00edme p\u0159e\u010dt\u011bte si pozorn\u011b v\u0161echny z\u00e1lo\u017eky, obzvl\u00e1\u0161t\u011b \u201ejudgov\u00e1n\u00ed\u201c!\r\n\r\nNa multiBLD je limit 14 sout\u011b\u017e\u00edc\u00edch a na FMC je limit 35 sout\u011b\u017e\u00edc\u00edch.","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"KoprCube2022","name":"KoprCube 2022","city":"Kop\u0159ivnice","country":"CZ","date":{"from":"2022-11-26","till":"2022-11-26","numberOfDays":1},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333oh","444","pyram"],"wcaDelegates":[{"name":"Karol Zakrzewski","email":"kzakrzewski@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"\u0160imon Borovsk\u00fd","email":"sborovsky@worldcubeassociation.org"}],"organisers":[{"name":"Pavel R\u00f6sner","email":"rezi@zaobzor.cz"}],"venue":{"name":"[D\u016fm d\u011bt\u00ed a ml\u00e1de\u017ee Kop\u0159ivnice](https:\/\/www.ddmkoprivnice.cz\/)","address":"Kpt. Jaro\u0161e 1077, 742 21, Kop\u0159ivnice","details":"Groundfloor","coordinates":{"latitude":49.597558,"longitude":18.144065}},"information":"Prvn\u00ed ofici\u00e1ln\u00ed sout\u011b\u017e v Kop\u0159ivnici.\r\nFirst official competition in Koprivnice.\r\n\r\nCze:\r\nSout\u011b\u017e prob\u011bhne v sobotu. Kdo bude m\u00edt z\u00e1jem dojet u\u017e v p\u00e1tek kv\u016fli vzd\u00e1lenosti nebo jen zkr\u00e1tka kv\u016fli lidem, akci, tr\u00e9ninku, nen\u00ed probl\u00e9m, od 18 h budou br\u00e1ny DDM otev\u0159eny. S sebou je nutn\u00e9 si tak vz\u00edt karimatku a spac\u00e1k. J\u00eddlo si \u00fa\u010dastn\u00edci zaji\u0161\u0165uj\u00ed sami. 150 m Albert, vietnamsk\u00e9 bistro, restaurace\u2026 Kontakt: Rezi 602 724 115, rezi@zaobzor.cz\r\n\r\nEng: \r\nCompetition will start on Saturday morning. If you want, you can arrive at Friday evening at 6 pm or later. We will be here, preparing the venue. Take your sleeping bag and mat, if you want spend the night here. It is for free. Food is up to you. There is supermarket Albert 150m from here, Vietnamese bistro, restaurants in the centre of the city and more. Contact: Rezi +420 602 724 115, rezi@zaobzor.cz\r\n","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"PragueOpen2022","name":"Prague Open 2022","city":"Praha","country":"CZ","date":{"from":"2022-10-29","till":"2022-10-30","numberOfDays":2},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333bf","444","555","clock","minx","pyram","skewb","sq1"],"wcaDelegates":[{"name":"Emma Beranov\u00e1","email":"eberanova@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Jakub Hamka\u0142o","email":"jhamkalo@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"\u0160imon Borovsk\u00fd","email":"sborovsky@worldcubeassociation.org"}],"organisers":[{"name":"Arsenij Kuprin","email":"kuprin.ars@gmail.com"},{"name":"Emma Beranov\u00e1","email":"eberanova@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Mat\u011bj Grohmann","email":"matejgrohmann1@gmail.com"},{"name":"Tom\u00e1\u0161 Nguyen","email":"tomas.nguyen159@gmail.com"